WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:05.260
Helpsters, our goal is to help Heart get back to us.

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:07.170
Any ideas, huh?

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:08.000
Wait.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.420
If I remember correctly, the rooms in our shop move around.

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:15.940
Oh yeah, we should stop them.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:21.770
Done.

00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:24.910
OK, so now that's taken care of, what do we do, huh?

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:27.050
First, we'll need a map of the shop.

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:29.850
Oh yes, yes we do, so that is job one.

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:32.080
[BELL] Get a map of the shop.

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.690
Next, we should find Heart on the map.

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:37.090
Yeah we should, so that'll be job two,

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:39.520
[BELL] figure out where Heart is on the map.

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:42.490
Then we need to find ourselves, and I

00:00:42.490 --> 00:00:46.120
mean on a map, none of this backpacking through Europe

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.770
after graduation business.

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:50.140
Huh?

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:51.020
Never mind.

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:54.310
OK, well job three, [BELL] figure out

00:00:54.310 --> 00:00:55.440
where we are on the map.

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:55.940
Yes.

00:00:55.940 --> 00:00:58.690
And once we do all that, then the last, [BELL]

00:00:58.690 --> 00:01:01.210
tell Heart how to get from there to here.

00:01:01.210 --> 00:01:03.130
So job one, get a map of the shop.

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:04.030
Let's do it.

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:06.880
Oh, I have a map on this tablet that

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:08.110
shows where the rooms stop.

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:08.610
Look.

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:09.280
Oh, great.

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:10.300
Perfect

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:11.410
Fantastic.

00:01:11.410 --> 00:01:13.680
Get a map of the shop, [BELL] check.

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:15.150
One job done.

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:16.860
Three more to go.

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:17.760
Yeah.

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:19.650
There's the horn room.

00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:22.680
Find out where Heart is on the map, [BELL] check.

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:26.430
And here we are at the counter where the customers sit.

00:01:26.430 --> 00:01:29.100
Figure out where we are, [BELL] check.

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:30.720
Three jobs done.

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:32.640
One more to go.

00:01:32.640 --> 00:01:35.190
Look at us getting it done here.

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:35.970
OK.

00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:38.860
So, uh Heart is there,

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:39.360
Mm-hmm.

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:40.805
And we are here.

00:01:40.805 --> 00:01:42.540
Yeah.

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:44.944
I think I see a path.

00:01:44.944 --> 00:01:48.600
[SQUEAKER] That is the best one.

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:50.280
Heart, I found a way back.

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:52.680
I'm going to give you commands, OK, ready?

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:54.220
Ready, Commander Cody.

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:55.140
All right.

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:58.950
First, open the door.

00:01:58.950 --> 00:02:00.660
I am opening the door.

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:02.880
[DOOR OPENING]

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:05.490
Next, walk forward through the room.

00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:07.410
Then open the other door.

00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:11.250
I am walking forward and opening the other door.

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:11.910
All right.

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:14.410
Then walk forward again.

00:02:14.410 --> 00:02:17.634
I am walking forward again.

00:02:17.634 --> 00:02:19.520
[VIDEO GAME SOUNDS]

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:21.020
Great.

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:24.920
Cody, you did it.

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:27.450
Heart is in the kitchen, right here.

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:30.950
[DOOR OPENING] It's empty.

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:32.030
Where's Heart?

00:02:32.030 --> 00:02:33.740
Heart, where are you?

00:02:33.740 --> 00:02:35.023
I am in the clouds.

00:02:35.023 --> 00:02:38.050
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:38.980
What?

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:39.810
Hang on, Heart.

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:41.860
You're up in the sky?

00:02:41.860 --> 00:02:46.150
No, it is a room filled with clouds,

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:48.190
which is very beautiful.

00:02:48.190 --> 00:02:50.560
There's the cloud room, right here.

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:53.470
But, how'd Heart get there?

00:02:53.470 --> 00:02:55.930
I see what happened.

00:02:55.930 --> 00:03:00.340
Heart went forward through two doors just like you said,

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:07.710
but instead of Heart going this way, Heart went that way.

00:03:07.710 --> 00:03:10.060
Oh, I am so sorry, Heart.

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:12.460
I should have been clearer with my instructions.

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:14.290
There's more than one door in each room,

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:17.180
and we need to make sure you're going in the right direction.

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:19.730
How about we tell Heart which room to go in next?

00:03:19.730 --> 00:03:21.490
Oh that's a great idea, Buddy bud.

00:03:21.490 --> 00:03:24.940
No, I see a different path to get Heart back to us.

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:26.020
Look here.

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:28.380
Heart should go this way.

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:28.880
Heart.

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:29.830
Heart.

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:32.440
Open the door to the stinky cheese room.

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:36.328
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:03:36.328 --> 00:03:37.300
[DOOR OPENING]

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:39.450
The stinky-- bleh!

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:41.350
The stinky cheese room.

00:03:41.350 --> 00:03:42.130
Excellent.

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:47.020
Now walk forward through the stinky cheese room.

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:49.150
No.

00:03:49.150 --> 00:03:51.010
What do you mean no?

00:03:51.010 --> 00:03:53.540
It is too stinky.

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:55.340
Well I know that it's stinky.

00:03:55.340 --> 00:03:57.460
It's the stinky cheese room.

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:59.270
I will not go that way.

00:03:59.270 --> 00:04:00.460
Thank you for your time.

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:02.200
But, but that is the path.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:06.580
The path is the path is the path is the path.

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:07.990
Oh frumplekins.

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:10.180
No, Mr. Primm I see another way.

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:13.750
All right, Heart, listen to me and listen good.

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:16.029
I know you've been through a lot today.

00:04:16.029 --> 00:04:17.019
Not really.

00:04:17.019 --> 00:04:19.329
It's been pretty nice actually.

00:04:19.329 --> 00:04:20.579
Oh, OK.

00:04:23.340 --> 00:04:24.720
I forgot what I was doing.

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:27.540
Helping Heart get back.

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:29.237
Oh yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:04:29.237 --> 00:04:30.070
Oh yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:31.140
OK.

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:37.515
All right, first find the blue room and walk forward into it.

00:04:37.515 --> 00:04:39.740
[VIDEO GAME SOUNDS]

00:04:39.740 --> 00:04:41.630
I am in the blue room.

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:43.820
I found it on my first try.

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:45.050
Oh, great.

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:48.380
Next command, find the glow-in-the-dark room and walk

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:49.270
forward into that.

00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:51.700
[VIDEO GAME SOUNDS]

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:55.390
OK I am in the glow-in-the-dark room.

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:58.630
Next command, find the door to the jungle room

00:04:58.630 --> 00:05:00.726
and walk forward into it.

00:05:00.726 --> 00:05:01.226
OK.

00:05:01.226 --> 00:05:05.618
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:05:05.618 --> 00:05:06.594
[DOOR OPENING]

00:05:06.594 --> 00:05:10.020
[JUNGLE SOUNDS]

00:05:10.020 --> 00:05:12.000
I am in the jungle room.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:16.230
Last command, walk forward through the jungle room

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:18.030
and open the door.

00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:20.970
[JUNGLE SOUNDS]

00:05:20.970 --> 00:05:21.950
[DOOR OPENING]

00:05:21.950 --> 00:05:23.420
Helpsters!

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:25.380
Heart!

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:27.500
Oh, Heart.

